cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code, please cite it as below."
title: "Entropy-Constrained Low-Rank COIN"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "S"
    given-names: "Siddharth"
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0009-2692-0917"
date-released: "2026-09-17"
url: "https://github.com/sidwastaken07/coin-lowrank-image-compression"
repository-code: "https://github.com/sidwastaken07/coin-lowrank-image-compression"
license: MIT
abstract: >
  Low-rank factorised SIREN image codec with a learned entropy model shared
  directly with the range coder, evaluated against a full-rank
  entropy-constrained COIN baseline on all 24 Kodak images. Companion code
  for a manuscript under review at IEEE Signal Processing Letters; citation
  details will be added on acceptance.
keywords:
  - image compression
  - implicit neural representations
  - entropy coding
  - low-rank factorisation
  - rate-distortion optimization
